      ],
      "text": "Agent-to-gateway messages use an AgentMessage wrapper (register, response, heartbeat, injection_ack, execute_pack_tool) and gateway-to-agent messages use a ServerMessage wrapper (welcome, send_message, shutdown, tool_approval, inject_context, cancel_request, pack_tool_result, registration_error)."
