  "summary": "Agents connect over a bidirectional gRPC stream to the AgentStream RPC of the coven.CovenControl service, defaulting to port 50051. The gateway exposes an HTTP API on port 8080 with endpoints for listing agents, sending messages with SSE streaming responses, health/readiness checks, and channel-binding CRUD. Evidence coverage: 170 of 361 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
  "superseded_claim_ids": []
